00:40:39,468 --> 00:40:40,469
>> NOPE, SINGLE.

1860
00:40:40,469 --> 00:40:41,270
>> NO? SINGLE MAN.

1861
00:40:41,270 --> 00:40:42,271
NO WONDER YOU DO SO MANY

1862
00:40:42,271 --> 00:40:43,239
ROMANCE COVERS.

1863
00:40:43,239 --> 00:40:44,240
NO ONE--NO ONE

1864
00:40:44,240 --> 00:40:45,241
TO TEAR YOU AWAY FROM THEM.

1865
00:40:45,241 --> 00:40:46,242
>> ANCHAL AND FABIO

1866
00:40:46,242 --> 00:40:47,243
WERE ON FIRE.

1867
00:40:47,243 --> 00:40:49,411
>> I LIKE IT.

1868
00:40:49,411 --> 00:40:51,113
>> I CAN'T LET MY SHYNESS

1869
00:40:51,113 --> 00:40:52,114
OR MY LOW SELF-ESTEEM

1870
00:40:52,114 --> 00:40:53,115
GET IN THE WAY

1871
00:40:53,115 --> 00:40:54,116
AND JUST MAKE ME BE LIKE,

1872
00:40:54,116 --> 00:40:55,117
OH, NO, I DON'T WANNA DO THIS.

1873
00:40:55,117 --> 00:40:56,118
AND PLUS, IT'S FABIO,

1874
00:40:56,118 --> 00:40:57,820
SO I HAVE TO IMPRESS.

1875
00:40:57,820 --> 00:40:58,954
>> BUT BROOKE'S PHOTO SHOOT

1876
00:40:58,954 --> 00:41:00,522
JUST RAN OUT OF STEAM.

1877
00:41:00,522 --> 00:41:01,523
>> WHEN YOU'RE LEANING IN,

1878
00:41:01,523 --> 00:41:01,857
I DON'T WANT YOU

1879
00:41:01,857 --> 00:41:02,858
TO LOSE YOUR NECK.

1880
00:41:02,858 --> 00:41:03,425
NOW I DON'T WANT YOU

1881
00:41:03,425 --> 00:41:04,026
TO START THINKING

1882
00:41:04,026 --> 00:41:05,027
MECHANICALLY ABOUT THIS.

1883
00:41:05,027 --> 00:41:06,028
IT'S LIKE YOU'RE TRYING

1884
00:41:06,028 --> 00:41:07,095
TO FIND CALM

1885
00:41:07,095 --> 00:41:08,096
IN THE MIDDLE OF ALL THIS PANIC.

1886
00:41:08,096 --> 00:41:11,733
PUT YOUR HAND UP HIGHER.

1887
00:41:13,368 --> 00:41:14,369
>> AT JUDGING,

1888
00:41:14,369 --> 00:41:15,370
BROOKE WAS CRITICIZED

1889
00:41:15,370 --> 00:41:16,538
FOR HER INHIBITIONS...

1890
00:41:16,538 --> 00:41:17,539
SHE SHOULD'VE MOVED MORE.

1891
00:41:17,539 --> 00:41:18,540
SHE SHOULD'VE

1892
00:41:18,540 --> 00:41:19,541
FELT THE STORY MORE

1893
00:41:19,541 --> 00:41:20,542
INSTEAD OF JUST GOING INSIDE,

1894
00:41:20,542 --> 00:41:22,644
LIKE, "I'M SAD. I'M POOR.

1895
00:41:22,644 --> 00:41:23,645
LOVE ME."

1896
00:41:23,645 --> 00:41:25,914
>> I JUST SEE UNCOMFORTABLENESS.

1897
00:41:25,914 --> 00:41:28,450
>> AND BROOKE WAS ELIMINATED.

1898
00:41:28,450 --> 00:41:29,451
>> (sobbing)

1899
00:41:29,451 --> 00:41:30,452
IT'S JUST HARD BECAUSE

1900
00:41:30,452 --> 00:41:32,287
I WANT THIS SO MUCH MORE

1901
00:41:32,287 --> 00:41:33,588
THAN--I THINK--

1902
00:41:33,588 --> 00:41:35,791
ALMOST ANY OF THOSE GIRLS.

1903
00:41:38,860 --> 00:41:39,861
>> NOW ONLY

1904
00:41:39,861 --> 00:41:41,096
SEVEN GIRLS REMAIN--

1905
00:41:41,096 --> 00:41:42,631
MELROSE, THE BOLD BEAUTY

1906
00:41:42,631 --> 00:41:43,832
WITH AN EYE FOR FASHION

1907
00:41:43,832 --> 00:41:45,967
FROM SAN FRANCISCO...

1908
00:41:45,967 --> 00:41:47,502
EUGENA, THE SEXY SIREN

1909
00:41:47,502 --> 00:41:49,104
WHO SIZZLES ON THE RUNWAY

1910
00:41:49,104 --> 00:41:50,972
FROM PALMDALE, CALIFORNIA...

1911
00:41:50,972 --> 00:41:52,240
A "TOP MODEL" FIRST--

1912
00:41:52,240 --> 00:41:54,142
MICHELLE, THE LONG, TALL TOMBOY

1913
00:41:54,142 --> 00:41:56,044
AND HER PHOTOGENIC TWIN AMANDA

1914
00:41:56,044 --> 00:41:57,979
FROM ANAHEIM, CALIFORNIA...

1915
00:41:57,979 --> 00:41:59,114
CARIDEE, THE STUNNER

1916
00:41:59,114 --> 00:42:00,649
FROM FARGO, NORTH DAKOTA,

1917
00:42:00,649 --> 00:42:01,650
WITH THE SUPERSIZED

1918
00:42:01,650 --> 00:42:03,518
PERSONALITY...

1919
00:42:03,518 --> 00:42:04,786
ANCHAL, THE GENTLE,

1920
00:42:04,786 --> 00:42:05,887
BREATHTAKING BEAUTY

1921
00:42:05,887 --> 00:42:08,457
FROM HOMESTEAD, FLORIDA...

1922
00:42:08,457 --> 00:42:09,458
AND JAEDA,

1923
00:42:09,458 --> 00:42:10,459
THE STATUESQUE STUDENT

1924
00:42:10,459 --> 00:42:12,427
FROM PARKERSBURG, IOWA.

1925
00:42:12,427 --> 00:42:13,428
DON'T MISS A MOMENT

1926
00:42:13,428 --> 00:42:14,429
WHEN WE FIND OUT

1927
00:42:14,429 --> 00:42:16,298
WHICH ONE OF THEM WILL BECOME

1928
00:42:16,298 --> 00:42:19,134
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

